    "Trains deal 10 more. Every 3.5s, throws 3 lumps of coal at the enemy (2 damage each).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Züge machen 10 mehr. Alle 3.5s wirft er 3 Kohlebrocken auf den Gegner (je 2 Schaden)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
